        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6W_ZcC5GjIqzjGSebAy4ClWtQil9mfaewjaLLkualXM5Xe0kHaGRbYy9_IWtnja6BJOQkK1FYk9Uss4haSQLb0xEtL6PtnmyAvjlw8jbyIaadWRoD_-iX1tyrTBXS3frS8NjwKfsQ2ip850MB56_75TdTT1lKyn5B8aMzpe0_kn8X0eDD1kZIDLWMeefHdvOGMGeb0A9w_6bYvucyYqwX6qTfVfHTAyVkAPCVn0eEzO9-M43pKgJRYRTt7I4meVcQQZwtT4cafN88usaXTSnsqDYHoDN6hQecsVn3tOxbiycSHqyvgFCilnOifCxDZJ9wissOSE7i_hI-geReawplOTTwbPye7jy3EBQv2AxB55QyJsuJYdmXc3rmgE4NbQxXYi8coB5fOdgS1vlLgJVMdl45rSUrk5MRQU4bzylDFWt_g1NA7bQ2nV_hcjxkVIvVGzkRLN__1RuRsOU3JPxjHZOERpDSRHRIL14ylytO-XvPUDVdWoqPcj1EFveBi5CwVCazg5CmY373IzZeoGxagJWaiehXygbApHoC24NTBrEOt67X9i_B5DAO_6QIYgz36xY0XL9dv68ohhHfeWoa6_tzKXQu4QGnSwtlAgO1hQeJ2nYUF-ojXRM0bG1i6x-FKxt8tw4mAPiiaS2eoWcZyf5r2w4JHPusrqvj_mO4E4t5pqjYtzj6G-X8g0UoFpoQlSehAAeuWN4-0r3N5RgVq7o8m_htTLKrFvn8rg0QtG-NZ69M-90ljHxxJ1O-Mj0cxvIMP9ytcyogDF3YkJ9naI4jPoECi3Xypl0qBH4abP_MeI-A-IpV7cXRTi5WBc-MyHqwdx8OQPVlSZXBBCCdx9BnToxAecv13RIxyCjLpn8AKqIlZuXAWhrvE6N4XNOe8i65Q6k09VJxLuqQdB8wzrnCOecG0weraBSvEhnC6J_NTYdB3eg" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Kulturkvarteret är en plats för stor och liten. Ett hus där du kan besöka utställningar, gå på bio, låna böcker, läsa tidningen, fika och använda gratis WiFi. I Kulturkvarteret finns även Hjo turistinformation VISIT HJO och aktuella utställningar. // In the cultural center you can visit the historical exhibition and learn more about Hjo, the wooden town and Hjos time as a spa resort. Visit Hjo - Hjo tourist information is also located in the building, there are free WIFI, toilets and an area where you can sit down and rest.<br>Bangatan 1 B, 544 30 Hjo<br>www.visithjo.se<br>www.kulturkvarterethjo.se <br>+46 503 352 55<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5AZ2rZFuiRNgvGhRWuyt9IFuKS2dDW66-KlFsDl7Vrfye8v8G0f2ipp7MF3qXvhyW1jjCIOQGQUKic6nT8DwBFQWVY_2YRmzMBc1ccIY8Na6vtPxwiz-ztee_pUs8ZSqWY49k6BttqovtKwKWTbrZlQ7hFC378NextSgpb8BdKH_WqT_X6PSnWohw8kO1sbcDdxLb6lLGHih_XwyTbCDwZsfkDFk7yxQCQAnZ7L_wooF1beKfq